    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Valbenazine, a vesicular monoamine transporter-2 inhibitor, is approved for tardive dyskinesia; it needs hepatic function monitoring during initiation. Most important adverse effects: hypersensitivity, somnolence, QT prolongation and parkinsonism."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
